Ibhuliyeni xa-kufika: ['xor:'] yenza: { :b <- ((ngokwakho kwaye: b hayi) okanye: (ngokwakho hayi kwaye: b)).
}.

Imveliso bhala: ['Length is:'] + ['ABCD'] ubude.
>> x := ['ABCDE'].

Imveliso bhala: ['Length is:'] + x ubude.
((['ABC'] ubude + 1 = 4) kwaye: (2 ≠ 3)) hayi hayi inyaniso: { Imveliso bhala: ['Yes']. }.
(((3 > 4) okanye: (4 > 2)) kwaye: (Inyaniso okanye: Ubuxoki), kwaye: (Inyaniso xor: Inyaniso) hayi ) inyaniso: { Imveliso bhala: ['Yes']. }.
{ Imveliso bhala: ['Running']. } qala.
